  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "──本日のゲストの西城樹里さんはですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "アイドルユニット『放課後クライマックスガールズ』\r\nのメンバーということで──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040110050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "普段は５人ユニットで活動していて、\r\n今日はアタシが代表として出演させてもらいます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "いやぁ、\r\nわざわざお越しいただきありがとうございます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い、いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "『放課後クライマックスガールズ』は\r\nどうやら年齢幅の広いユニットのようですね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はい、そうなんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "小学生から、20歳まで\r\n幅広い感じでやらせてもらってます……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "おお、小学生のメンバーまでいるとは……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "西城さん以外には、\r\nどんな方がいらっしゃるんでしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えーとですね──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まず、小宮果穂\r\nリーダーなんだけど、可愛い妹みたいでもあるし──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でも、元気いっぱいにユニットを引っ張ってくれる\r\n頼れるヤツなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "で、アタシと同じ高校２年生で\r\nザ・女の子って感じの園田智代子",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "色々器用にこなせて、面倒見も良くて\r\n……ユニットに、欠かせない存在だと思います",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それから、年下とは思えないくらい\r\n落ち着いた雰囲気の杜野凛世",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "頭が良くて物知りの大和撫子だけど、\r\n大人しいだけじゃなく、実は結構面白いヤツで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "最後に、ストイックな最年長\r\n有栖川夏葉",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "って言っても結構子どもっぽいとこもあって……\r\nだから一緒にいて楽なのかもしれないですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……こんな感じで、\r\n結構個性的なメンバーが集まったユニットです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "なるほど。それでは西城さんは\r\nユニットではどんな立ち位置なんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アタシは──\r\nなんだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "──おっ、SNSでは『常識人枠！』\r\nという声がたくさん上がってるみたいですね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "常識人……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "や、アタシ以外のメンバーみんなも、\r\nちゃんと常識はあるんですよ！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "あははは！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ラジオパーソナリティ",
    "text": "西城さん、おもしろいなぁ！\r\nちょっと天然なんですね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えっ……！\r\nそれ、あんまり言われたことないです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030200"
  },
