  {
    "id": 2011011030210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "つっ…………かれた…………！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "002",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "地方のラジオ番組って\r\nこんなに勝手が違うものなんだな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、樹里",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "また今日の番組は、\r\nリスナーの層がいつもとはだいぶ違うものだからなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なぁ、アタシ変なこと言ってなかったか？\r\n緊張でなんも覚えてない……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "30分間、楽しいトークができてた\r\nよく頑張ったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "パーソナリティの人に\r\nリードしてもらいながら、なんとかだけどな……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "中でも……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特に、メンバーの紹介なんか\r\nすごくよかったと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030260"
  },
  {
    "select": "樹里、あんなふうに\r\n思ってたんだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "是非みんなに\r\n聞かせてあげたいな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "放クラの良さが\r\n伝わったと思うよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030270,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、あれは……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ただわかりやすく伝えようとした結果\r\nっつーか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "くそ、何言ったかあんまり思い出せねー……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "サイトで聞き逃し配信があるから\r\n今なら聴けるぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……や、そ、それは──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011030320,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……あとでひとりで聴くっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101103/2011011030320"
  },
